{
  "sourceLanguage": "ja",
  "strings": {
    "凪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今すぐ見る": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See It Now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "凪を終了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Nagi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ まで一時停止中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paused Until %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 時間": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For 1 Hour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "いつもどおり": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As Usual"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ふつう": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Normal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ゆっくり": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Slow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "エフェクト": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Effects"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "キーボードとマウスから手を離して %lld 秒たつと、画面に木漏れ日が少しずつ現れます。手を動かすと、すぐに消えます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When your hands have been off the keyboard and mouse for %lld seconds, komorebi slowly appears on the screen. It disappears as soon as you move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "コマ数を半分にする": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Halve the Frame Rate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "システム設定での許可が必要です": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs approval in System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログイン時に起動": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open at Login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログイン項目を変更できません: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t change the login item: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ログイン項目を開く": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Login Items"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一時停止": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一時停止と設定は、メニューバーの葉のアイコンから開けます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pause and Settings are in the leaf icon in the menu bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今日いっぱい": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the Rest of Today"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低電力モードのとき": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Low Power Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全体の強さ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Overall Strength"
          }
        }
      }
    },
